sequenceDiagram

participant UI

participant App Layer

participant UDS

participant ISO-TP

participant CAN Driver

participant MCP2515

participant CAN Bus

participant ECU


UI->>App Layer: User Command

App Layer->>UDS: Create UDS Request

UDS->>ISO-TP: Pass Payload

ISO-TP->>CAN Driver: Frame(s)


alt MCP2515 Interface

CAN Driver->>MCP2515: SPI Transfer

MCP2515->>CAN Bus: Transmit

else PCAN USB Interface

CAN Driver->>CAN Bus: Direct via USB

end


CAN Bus->>ECU: Deliver Message

ECU->>CAN Bus: Response


CAN Bus->>MCP2515: Receive

MCP2515->>CAN Driver: SPI Read

CAN Driver->>ISO-TP: Frame(s)

ISO-TP->>UDS: Reassemble

UDS->>App Layer: Parsed Response

App Layer->>UI: Display Output